CATEGORIES:Holidays
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-05-28MV272regcountry@mv-holidays
DTSTAMP:20261107T193853Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260528
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260529
SUMMARY:Eid-ul Al'haa
DESCRIPTION:Eid al-Adha, the Feast of Sacrifice is the most important feast in the Muslim calendar. It celebrates the willingness of the Prophet Ibrahim to sacrifice his son Ishmael in submission to Allah's command, before he was stopped by Allah.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CATEGORIES:Holidays
END:VEVENT
